{
  "name": "skinning-weight-debugger",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Three.js + TypeScript 蒙皮权重调试场景:三骨骼带状网格、权重热力图、笔刷、锁定归一、绑定姿态、预设与存档",
